  "friday": {
    "_comment": "疯狂星期五：每天从 pool 里随机挑几件按倍率收购，basePrices 是基准价。pool 支持具体物品、#标签、*通配；每个池子条目默认每天最多被挑中 1 件，poolMaxPicks 只用来把某一类调大。*_spawn_egg 表示任意刷怪蛋（含其他模组）作为一个整类条目，抽中后玩家卖任意一种刷怪蛋都按该行价格结算。\nCrazy Friday: a few items are picked from pool each day and bought with a multiplier; basePrices are the base prices. pool accepts plain item ids, #tags and * wildcards. Each pool entry contributes at most 1 item per day by default. *_spawn_egg is a whole-class entry: any spawn egg (modded included) sells at that row's price.",
    "lang": "acquire.category.friday",
    "name": "疯狂星期五",
    "pool": [
      "minecraft:nether_star",
      "minecraft:elytra",
      "minecraft:trident",
      "minecraft:heart_of_the_sea",
      "minecraft:echo_shard",
